    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A mysterious and slightly melancholic adventure of the slime cat, Tama.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tama, a slime cat, wanders through a fantastical world drawn in charming pixel art.<br>It seems like she\u2019s searching for something, though even Tama herself isn\u2019t quite sure what that is.<br>With hazy emotions in her heart, she quietly continues her journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an action-puzzle game where you use three unique abilities\u2014<strong>Absorb</strong>, <strong>Split</strong>, and <strong>Swap</strong>\u2014to progress through mysterious stages.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 Tama\u2019s Unique Abilities</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Absorb</strong>: Pick up scattered slime to grow in size. Becoming larger helps with splitting.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/73e4b4c16517a0e4bafcb30d3e479947.poster.avif?t=1753449144\" width=200 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/73e4b4c16517a0e4bafcb30d3e479947.webm?t=1753449144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/73e4b4c16517a0e4bafcb30d3e479947.mp4?t=1753449144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Split</strong>: Divide your body into parts, allowing you to exist in multiple places at once or reach high ledges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/9bfc98037394bf9c4a7c7629c1bed1b9.poster.avif?t=1753449144\" width=200 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/9bfc98037394bf9c4a7c7629c1bed1b9.webm?t=1753449144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/9bfc98037394bf9c4a7c7629c1bed1b9.mp4?t=1753449144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swap</strong>: Possess a split slime body to switch control and solve puzzles from a new position.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/8bfb0d201d8567b6dccce464ef996b63.poster.avif?t=1753449144\" width=200 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/8bfb0d201d8567b6dccce464ef996b63.webm?t=1753449144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/8bfb0d201d8567b6dccce464ef996b63.mp4?t=1753449144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strange world filled with mysteries and a faint sense of loneliness awaits.<br>Use clever thinking and creative control to guide Tama on her quiet, emotional journey.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A mysterious and slightly melancholic adventure of the slime cat, Tama.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tama, a slime cat, wanders through a fantastical world drawn in charming pixel art.<br>It seems like she\u2019s searching for something, though even Tama herself isn\u2019t quite sure what that is.<br>With hazy emotions in her heart, she quietly continues her journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an action-puzzle game where you use three unique abilities\u2014<strong>Absorb</strong>, <strong>Split</strong>, and <strong>Swap</strong>\u2014to progress through mysterious stages.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 Tama\u2019s Unique Abilities</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Absorb</strong>: Pick up scattered slime to grow in size. Becoming larger helps with splitting.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/73e4b4c16517a0e4bafcb30d3e479947.poster.avif?t=1753449144\" width=200 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/73e4b4c16517a0e4bafcb30d3e479947.webm?t=1753449144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/73e4b4c16517a0e4bafcb30d3e479947.mp4?t=1753449144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Split</strong>: Divide your body into parts, allowing you to exist in multiple places at once or reach high ledges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/9bfc98037394bf9c4a7c7629c1bed1b9.poster.avif?t=1753449144\" width=200 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.